          "step_number": 1,
          "title": "Step 1",
          "instruction": "Heat oven to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6. Fry the onions and thyme sprigs in the oil until softened and lightly coloured (about 5 mins)."
        },
        {
          "step_number": 2,
          "title": "Step 2",
          "instruction": "Spread a layer of potatoes over the base of a 1.5-litre oiled gratin dish. Sprinkle over a few onions (see picture, above) and continue layering, finishing with a layer of potatoes. Pour over the stock and bake for 50-60 mins until the potatoes are cooked and the top is golden and crisp."
        }
